#N canvas 50 50 1100 900 10;
#X text 20 5 Frasil - an ambient drone voice after FRASIL (Styves Goupil): CHOEUR \, three detuned saws through a soft low-pass \; PARTIELS \, additive partials whose levels wander \; SOUFFLE \, breath noise ringing resonators tuned to the note. Every voice drifts on its own. Breath swells and opens it \; MPE timbre (CC 74) opens it per note. Knobs: Layers (choir .. partials) \, Souffle \, Motion \, Timbre. Each layer runs (with its own slow-rate controls) only while it is turned up.;
